# Build context for apps/wildflower-relay/Dockerfile (repository root). Cargo
# loads every workspace member, so the Rust trees stay; everything else, and
# all build output and node_modules, is left out.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!apps/
!plugins/
!slices/
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.vite
